#X text 247 430 [oscsend <host> <port> </address> <arg1> <arg2> ...
<argn>( Independent utility method for sending any osc-messages to
any host and any port. Every call can have different host/ports/address/args!
;
#X text 392 171 The "variation" is a time added to the period. For
a Zyklus it calculates all possible permutations. THe variation must
be equal or longer as the period. When the variation is longer than
the period \, the permutations trucated to the length of the period
\, then all unique perms are taken.;
#X text 389 753 resend as osc to an other client/port/address;
#X text 268 135 The "period" can have any length!;
#X msg 250 406 oscsend localhost 10000 /gaga/uhu 200 100 miau;
